      "message": "fix(sim): guard NC approaches, taper tips and mesh fidelity\n\nPreserve known initial motion and refuse unknown starts. Reject unread taper tips from every tool source and share strict mesh-fidelity preparation between simulation and playback.\n\nFixes #2218",
